Test 3 — NAT/PAT Translation

After generating traffic:

show ip nat translations

and:

show ip nat statistics

Important: If show ip nat translations shows nothing, that does not automatically mean NAT is broken. A translation appears when traffic actually matches the NAT rule and creates a translatable flow.

10. Verification Commands

Useful commands for troubleshooting:

